1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,008
Bugungi videomiz qanday? Kafedagi suhbat.

2
00:00:10,008 --> 00:00:11,508
1-qism: Yapon tilida buyurtma berish / Yapon tilida qanday buyurtma berish kerak

3
00:00:11,508 --> 00:00:13,508
Xush kelibsiz!

4
00:00:13,530 --> 00:00:16,297
Buyurtmangizni belgiladingizmi?

5
00:00:16,320 --> 00:00:18,053
Ha.

6
00:00:18,076 --> 00:00:21,249
Menga bitta muzli kofe bering.

7
00:00:21,273 --> 00:00:24,441
Muzli kofe, tushunarli.

8
00:00:24,464 --> 00:00:27,705
Hajmini tanlaysizmi?

9
00:00:27,729 --> 00:00:32,262
Short, Tall va Grande oʻlchamlari mavjud.

10
00:00:32,285 --> 00:00:35,052
Tall oʻlchamini iltimos qilaman.

11
00:00:35,075 --> 00:00:37,208
Tushunarli.

12
00:00:37,231 --> 00:00:39,431
Tall oʻlchami, shundaymi?

13
00:00:39,454 --> 00:00:42,621
Ichib ketasizmi yoki olib ketasizmi?

14
00:00:42,644 --> 00:00:46,577
Yoʻq, olib ketaman.

15
00:00:46,600 --> 00:00:48,767
Tushunarli.

16
00:00:48,790 --> 00:00:51,157
Olib ketish, tushunarli.

17
00:00:51,180 --> 00:00:55,113
Sut yoki sirop qoʻshasizmi?

18
00:00:55,136 --> 00:00:57,736
Yoʻq, kerak emas.

19
00:00:57,759 --> 00:00:59,832
Maʼlum.

20
00:00:59,855 --> 00:01:03,055
Yana buyurtma berasizmi?

21
00:01:03,078 --> 00:01:06,478
Bu yegulikni koʻrasizmi?

22
00:01:06,501 --> 00:01:08,168
Hmm...

23
00:01:08,191 --> 00:01:11,469
Menga bitta shokoladli skon ham bering.

24
00:01:11,493 --> 00:01:14,226
Shokoladli skon, shundaymi?

25
00:01:14,249 --> 00:01:16,685
Iltimos, iliqtaring.

26
00:01:16,709 --> 00:01:18,345
Ha.

27
00:01:18,369 --> 00:01:20,502
Iliqtiring.

28
00:01:20,525 --> 00:01:23,058
Tushunarli.

29
00:01:23,081 --> 00:01:26,214
Iliq qilinsa, yanada mazali boʻladi.

30
00:01:26,237 --> 00:01:28,004
Rahmat.

31
00:01:28,027 --> 00:01:31,160
Endi hisob-kitob qilamiz.

32
00:01:31,183 --> 00:01:39,037
Muzli kofe Tall oʻlchami va shokoladli skon — jami 750 yen.

33
00:01:39,061 --> 00:01:42,094
Kredit karta bilan toʻlash mumkinmi?

34
00:01:42,117 --> 00:01:44,717
Ha, mumkin.

35
00:01:44,740 --> 00:01:48,594
Kartangizni shu mashinkaga teging.

36
00:01:48,618 --> 00:01:51,716
Ha, tegdim.

37
00:01:51,740 --> 00:01:53,306
Rahmat.

38
00:01:53,329 --> 00:01:57,409
Toʻlov yakunlandi.

39
00:01:57,433 --> 00:02:01,166
Chek va chaqiruv raqamingizni oling.

40
00:02:01,189 --> 00:02:02,674
Rahmat.

41
00:02:02,698 --> 00:02:06,510
Mahsulotlar shu yerda beriladi.

42
00:02:06,533 --> 00:02:10,733
Raqamingiz chaqirilgunga qadar biroz kutib turing.

43
00:02:10,756 --> 00:02:12,569
Tushunarli.

44
00:02:12,593 --> 00:02:14,593
U yerda, shundaymi?

45
00:02:14,616 --> 00:02:17,950
Ha, shunday.

46
00:02:17,973 --> 00:02:22,263
Skonni iliqtiryapmiz, taxminan 2 daqiqa kerak boʻladi.

47
00:02:22,286 --> 00:02:24,153
Tushunarli.

48
00:02:24,176 --> 00:02:26,610
Kutingiz uchun uzr.

49
00:02:26,632 --> 00:02:29,078
15-raqamli mijoz.

50
00:02:29,101 --> 00:02:32,438
Ha, men.

51
00:02:32,462 --> 00:02:34,477
Kutingiz uchun uzr.

52
00:02:34,500 --> 00:02:40,333
Sizga muzli kofe Tall oʻlchami va iliq shokoladli skon.

53
00:02:40,356 --> 00:02:41,890
Rahmat.

54
00:02:41,913 --> 00:02:43,779
Mazali koʻrinadi!

55
00:02:43,802 --> 00:02:48,936
Skon juda issiq, olib ketishda ehtiyot boʻling.

56
00:02:48,959 --> 00:02:50,825
Tushunarli.

57
00:02:50,848 --> 00:02:52,382
Rahmat.

58
00:02:52,405 --> 00:02:57,638
Solomoni va salfetkalarni shu yerdan olishingiz mumkin.

59
00:02:57,661 --> 00:02:59,636
Tushunarli.

60
00:02:59,659 --> 00:03:01,592
Rahmat!

61
00:03:01,615 --> 00:03:03,849
Yana kelishingizni kutamiz!

62
00:03:03,872 --> 00:03:06,121
Rahmat.

63
00:03:06,145 --> 00:03:15,154
Bugungi videoning skriptini tavsiflar va eng yaxshi izohlar boʻlimidan yuklab olishingiz mumkin. Yuklab olishdan oldin izoh qoldirishni unutmang.

64
00:03:15,154 --> 00:03:16,654
Sahna 2: Ertalabki tayyorgarlikning asoslari

65
00:03:16,654 --> 00:03:21,544
Endi ertalabki tayyorgarlikni boshlaymiz.

66
00:03:21,568 --> 00:03:25,701
Avvalo, qahva donalarini tekshiring.

67
00:03:25,724 --> 00:03:27,457
Ha.

68
00:03:27,480 --> 00:03:30,247
Bu donalar, shundaymi?

69
00:03:30,270 --> 00:03:33,803
Paketdagi sanani koʻring.

70
00:03:33,826 --> 00:03:36,460
Bu yangi donalarmi?

71
00:03:36,482 --> 00:03:38,291
Ha.

72
00:03:38,315 --> 00:03:41,283
Kecha yetib kelgan donalar.

73
00:03:41,306 --> 00:03:43,173
Ajoyib!

74
00:03:43,196 --> 00:03:46,329
Donalarning hidi qanday?

75
00:03:46,352 --> 00:03:49,403
Juda yaxshi hid kelmoqda.

76
00:03:49,426 --> 00:03:52,494
Tazaligi muammosiz.

77
00:03:52,518 --> 00:03:55,529
Yaxshi boʻldi.

78
00:03:55,552 --> 00:04:00,552
Keyin, muzlatgich haroratini tekshiring.

79
00:04:00,575 --> 00:04:03,870
Muzlatgich 4 daraja.

80
00:04:03,893 --> 00:04:07,790
Issiq saqlagich 60 daraja.

81
00:04:07,814 --> 00:04:10,512
Ikkalasi ham yaxshi.

82
00:04:10,536 --> 00:04:14,469
Endi sendvich tayyorlaymiz.

83
00:04:14,492 --> 00:04:18,425
Nonni necha boʻlakka kesamiz?

84
00:04:18,448 --> 00:04:21,022
10 boʻlakka kesing.

85
00:04:21,046 --> 00:04:23,979
Ingichka qilib kesing.

86
00:04:24,002 --> 00:04:26,136
Tushunarli.

87
00:04:26,159 --> 00:04:28,892
Sabzavotlarni ham yuvamizmi?

88
00:04:28,915 --> 00:04:30,482
Ha.

89
00:04:30,505 --> 00:04:34,638
Salat barglari va pomidorni toza yuving.

90
00:04:34,661 --> 00:04:37,953
Vetchina va pishloqni ham olib chiqayapman.

91
00:04:37,976 --> 00:04:39,748
Iltimos.

92
00:04:39,772 --> 00:04:43,007
Tuxumli salat ham tayyorlaymiz.

93
00:04:43,030 --> 00:04:46,688
Qaynatilgan tuxumdan nechtasini ishlatamiz?

94
00:04:46,711 --> 00:04:49,311
8 ta ishlatamiz.

95
00:04:49,334 --> 00:04:52,821
Kasalada ezing.

96
00:04:52,844 --> 00:04:54,262
Ha.

97
00:04:54,286 --> 00:04:56,620
Hozir tayyorlayman.

98
00:04:56,643 --> 00:05:00,209
Soat 8gacha hammasini tayyorlaymiz.

99
00:05:00,232 --> 00:05:01,665
Ha.

100
00:05:01,688 --> 00:05:03,822
Yetkazamiz.

101
00:05:03,845 --> 00:05:10,950
Bugungi videoni takrorlash uchun sayt havolasini tavsiflar va eng yaxshi izohlarda topishingiz mumkin. *Sayt oldindan ogohlantirmasdan oʻchirilishi mumkin.

102
00:05:10,950 --> 00:05:12,450
Sahna 3: Ochilish oldidan tayyorgarlik va band soatlar

103
00:05:12,450 --> 00:05:15,416
Endi soat 8 boʻladi.

104
00:05:15,439 --> 00:05:18,073
Ochilishga 10 daqiqa qoldi.

105
00:05:18,096 --> 00:05:22,234
Ha, tayyorgarlik deyarli tugadi.

106
00:05:22,257 --> 00:05:24,790
Bugun ham yaxshi ishlaymiz!

107
00:05:24,813 --> 00:05:29,147
Bugungi ob-havo qandayligini bilasizmi?

108
00:05:29,170 --> 00:05:30,903
Ha.

109
00:05:30,926 --> 00:05:34,165
Tushdan keyin yomgʻir yogʻadi.

110
00:05:34,189 --> 00:05:35,955
Hmm...

111
00:05:35,978 --> 00:05:39,978
Shuning uchun ertalab mijozlar koʻp keladi.

112
00:05:40,001 --> 00:05:41,768
Tushunarli.

113
00:05:41,791 --> 00:05:45,324
Ayniqsa, qaysi vaqtda band boʻladi?

114
00:05:45,347 --> 00:05:49,281
Odatda 12 dan 2 gacha.

115
00:05:49,304 --> 00:05:53,509
Tushlik payti juda band boʻladi.

116
00:05:53,532 --> 00:05:54,899
Tushunarli.

117
00:05:54,922 --> 00:05:57,388
Ehtiyot boʻlamiz.

118
00:05:57,411 --> 00:06:01,178
Bugungi maqsadli savdo 100 000 yen.

119
00:06:01,201 --> 00:06:03,734
100 000 yen, shundaymi?

120
00:06:03,757 --> 00:06:06,691
Yangi tort ham sotamizmi?

121
00:06:06,714 --> 00:06:08,380
Ha.

122
00:06:08,403 --> 00:06:12,437
Mavsumiy tortlarni mijozlarga tavsiya qiling.

123
00:06:12,460 --> 00:06:14,264
Tushunarli.

124
00:06:14,288 --> 00:06:17,867
“Bugungi tavsiya” deb ayting.

125
00:06:17,890 --> 00:06:19,823
Ajoyib!

126
00:06:19,846 --> 00:06:24,046
Keyin rol taqsimotini belgilaymiz.

127
00:06:24,069 --> 00:06:25,836
Ha.

128
00:06:25,859 --> 00:06:28,826
Men nima qilaman?

129
00:06:28,849 --> 00:06:31,824
Mayk-san, kassani olib borasiz.

130
00:06:31,847 --> 00:06:35,580
Hisob-kitob va buyurtmalarni qabul qiling.

131
00:06:35,603 --> 00:06:37,491
Tushunarli.

132
00:06:37,515 --> 00:06:40,781
Men kassani boshqaraman.

133
00:06:40,804 --> 00:06:44,338
Men ichimliklar va taomlarni tayyorlayman.

134
00:06:44,361 --> 00:06:47,894
Band vaqtlarda bir-biringizga yordam bering.

135
00:06:47,917 --> 00:06:49,650
Ha.

136
00:06:49,673 --> 00:06:51,683
Iltimos, yaxshi munosabatda boʻlaylik.

137
00:06:51,706 --> 00:06:55,106
Endi doʻkonni ochamiz.

138
00:06:55,130 --> 00:06:56,696
Ha.

139
00:06:56,719 --> 00:06:58,738
Ochamiz!

140
00:06:58,762 --> 00:07:00,262
4-Sahna: Ertalab kafedagi suhbat / Nonushta vaqtidagi kofe suhbati

141
00:07:00,262 --> 00:07:02,595
Xayrli tong!

142
00:07:02,618 --> 00:07:05,151
Xush kelibsiz!

143
00:07:05,174 --> 00:07:07,578
Xayrli tong!

144
00:07:07,602 --> 00:07:10,769
Bugun ham ob-havo yaxshi ekan.

145
00:07:10,792 --> 00:07:12,725
Ha.

146
00:07:12,748 --> 00:07:16,406
Hozir havo juda iliq.

147
00:07:16,430 --> 00:07:19,630
Har doim buyurtma qiladigan nonushta toʻplamingizmi?

148
00:07:19,653 --> 00:07:21,386
Ha.

149
00:07:21,409 --> 00:07:23,409
Iltimos.

150
00:07:23,432 --> 00:07:27,365
Sariyogʻli tost va qora kofe.

151
00:07:27,388 --> 00:07:29,389
Ha.

152
00:07:29,413 --> 00:07:33,146
Kofeni issiqroq qilib bering.

153
00:07:33,169 --> 00:07:35,424
Tushunarli.

154
00:07:35,447 --> 00:07:38,381
Stolga oʻtirishingiz mumkin.

155
00:07:38,404 --> 00:07:40,204
Rahmat.

156
00:07:40,227 --> 00:07:43,960
Bugun biroz erta keldim.

157
00:07:43,983 --> 00:07:45,759
Hmm...

158
00:07:45,782 --> 00:07:49,749
Har doim soat sakkiz yarimda kelasan-ku.

159
00:07:49,772 --> 00:07:53,425
Bugun soat toʻqqizdan ish bor.

160
00:07:53,448 --> 00:07:55,543
Qiyin boʻlsa kerak.

161
00:07:55,566 --> 00:07:57,733
Kutib turgʻazdingiz.

162
00:07:57,756 --> 00:08:00,222
Nonushta toʻplamingiz tayyor.

163
00:08:00,245 --> 00:08:02,012
Rahmat.

164
00:08:02,035 --> 00:08:04,168
Mazali koʻrinadi!

165
00:08:04,191 --> 00:08:08,958
Bu hafta yomgʻir koʻp boʻldi-ku.

166
00:08:08,981 --> 00:08:10,617
Ha.

167
00:08:10,641 --> 00:08:14,374
Kiyimlarim qurimadi.

168
00:08:14,397 --> 00:08:18,568
Bugun tushdan keyin yomgʻir yogʻadi ekan.

169
00:08:18,591 --> 00:08:21,490
A, shundaymi?

170
00:08:21,514 --> 00:08:24,721
Zontik olib kelganim yaxshi boʻldi.

171
00:08:24,744 --> 00:08:27,379
Yoqimli ishtaha boʻldi.

172
00:08:27,402 --> 00:08:29,207
Rahmat.

173
00:08:29,231 --> 00:08:32,847
Hisob-kitob 500 yendan.

174
00:08:32,871 --> 00:08:35,904
Aynan 500 yen toʻlayman.

175
00:08:35,927 --> 00:08:37,494
Rahmat.

176
00:08:37,517 --> 00:08:41,083
Bugun ham ishda omad tilaymiz!

177
00:08:41,106 --> 00:08:42,885
Ha.

178
00:08:42,909 --> 00:08:44,842
Ketaman.

179
00:08:44,865 --> 00:08:46,913
Xayr, borib keling!

180
00:08:46,937 --> 00:08:49,670
Yana kutamiz.

181
00:08:49,693 --> 00:08:51,193
5-Sahna: Tez buyurtma qabul qilish / Tez buyurtma xizmati

182
00:08:51,193 --> 00:08:53,231
Xush kelibsiz!

183
00:08:53,255 --> 00:08:55,658
Xayrli tong!

184
00:08:55,681 --> 00:08:58,348
Xayrli tong!

185
00:08:58,371 --> 00:09:03,189
Kechirasiz, juda shoshilyapman.

186
00:09:03,213 --> 00:09:07,746
Poyezd vaqtimga oʻn daqiqa qoldi.

187
00:09:07,769 --> 00:09:09,769
Tushunarli.

188
00:09:09,792 --> 00:09:12,428
Tezda tayyorlab beramiz.

189
00:09:12,452 --> 00:09:16,624
Eng tez tayyor boʻladigan ichimlik nima?

190
00:09:16,647 --> 00:09:20,494
Eng tez tayyor boʻladigani muzli kafe latte.

191
00:09:20,518 --> 00:09:24,391
Shunday boʻlsa, muzli kafe latte bering.

192
00:09:24,414 --> 00:09:28,481
Oʻlchami M oʻlchamda boʻladimi?

193
00:09:28,504 --> 00:09:32,470
Ha, M oʻlchamda qilib bering.

194
00:09:32,493 --> 00:09:35,027
Uydan olib ketish uchunmi?

195
00:09:35,050 --> 00:09:38,709
Ha, olib ketish uchun.

196
00:09:38,732 --> 00:09:42,372
Shakar yoki sut qoʻshasizmi?

197
00:09:42,395 --> 00:09:45,869
Yo'q, solmang.

198
00:09:45,893 --> 00:09:48,779
Muzni kamroq qilsak bo‘ladi mi?

199
00:09:48,802 --> 00:09:51,657
Ha, bo‘ladi.

200
00:09:51,680 --> 00:09:55,047
Muzni kamroq solamiz.

201
00:09:55,070 --> 00:09:57,436
To‘lov necha pul bo‘ladi?

202
00:09:57,459 --> 00:10:01,474
Jami to‘rt yuz ellik yen.

203
00:10:01,498 --> 00:10:04,431
Elektron pul bilan to‘lash mumkinmi?

204
00:10:04,454 --> 00:10:08,021
Ha, foydalanishingiz mumkin.

205
00:10:08,044 --> 00:10:10,855
Bu mashinaga tegib ko‘ring.

206
00:10:10,878 --> 00:10:13,644
Ha, tegdim.

207
00:10:13,667 --> 00:10:15,267
Rahmat.

208
00:10:15,290 --> 00:10:18,224
To‘lov yakunlandi.

209
00:10:18,247 --> 00:10:22,052
Olib ketish uchun paketdan foydalanasizmi?

210
00:10:22,075 --> 00:10:25,283
Ha, paket bering iltimos.

211
00:10:25,306 --> 00:10:30,106
Sovuq ekan, stakan uchun qopqoq ham qo‘shamiz.

212
00:10:30,129 --> 00:10:33,298
Ha, yaxshi bo‘ladi.

213
00:10:33,321 --> 00:10:36,055
Uzoq kutib qoldingiz, uzr.

214
00:10:36,078 --> 00:10:39,411
M o‘lchamdagi muzli kafe latte.

215
00:10:39,434 --> 00:10:40,909
Rahmat.

216
00:10:40,932 --> 00:10:43,766
Tez tayyor bo‘lib qoldi, yaxshi.

217
00:10:43,789 --> 00:10:45,670
Xayr, yo‘lga chiqing.

218
00:10:45,693 --> 00:10:47,296
Ehtiyot bo‘ling.

219
00:10:47,320 --> 00:10:50,720
Ha, ketaman.

220
00:10:50,743 --> 00:10:52,243
6-SAHNA: Ertalabki suhbat va kun tartibini tasdiqlash

221
00:10:52,243 --> 00:10:54,645
Xayrli tong!

222
00:10:54,669 --> 00:10:57,802
Bugun ham ob-havo yaxshi ekan.

223
00:10:57,825 --> 00:11:00,158
Xayrli tong!

224
00:11:00,181 --> 00:11:02,148
Hmm...

225
00:11:02,171 --> 00:11:05,388
Kofeni allaqachon oldingizmi?

226
00:11:05,411 --> 00:11:07,178
Ha.

227
00:11:07,201 --> 00:11:10,652
Issiq kafe latte sotib oldim.

228
00:11:10,676 --> 00:11:14,153
Men issiq kofeni tanladim.

229
00:11:14,177 --> 00:11:18,510
Endi bugungi kun tartibini tekshirib olamiz.

230
00:11:18,533 --> 00:11:20,267
Ha.

231
00:11:20,290 --> 00:11:22,158
Iltimos.

232
00:11:22,181 --> 00:11:26,473
Bugun soat 10 dan yig‘ilishimiz bor-ku.

233
00:11:26,497 --> 00:11:28,264
Ha.

234
00:11:28,287 --> 00:11:32,062
Yangi loyiha taqdimoti.

235
00:11:32,085 --> 00:11:35,353
Hujjatlar tayyormi?

236
00:11:35,377 --> 00:11:37,143
Ha.

237
00:11:37,166 --> 00:11:40,966
Kecha kechgacha hammasini tekshirib chiqdim.

238
00:11:40,990 --> 00:11:43,523
Ajoyib!

239
00:11:43,546 --> 00:11:46,638
Yana bir bor birga ko‘rib chiqamiz.

240
00:11:46,662 --> 00:11:48,300
Ha.

241
00:11:48,323 --> 00:11:51,357
Bu bugungi hujjatlar.

242
00:11:51,380 --> 00:11:54,113
Ikkinchi sahifaga qarang.

243
00:11:54,136 --> 00:11:57,337
Bu raqamlar to‘g‘rimi?

244
00:11:57,361 --> 00:11:59,294
Ha.

245
00:11:59,317 --> 00:12:02,384
O‘tgan haftadagi ma'lumotlar bilan bir xil.

246
00:12:02,407 --> 00:12:04,773
Tushunarli.

247
00:12:04,796 --> 00:12:07,263
Juda ko‘rinib turibdi.

248
00:12:07,286 --> 00:12:09,019
Rahmat.

249
00:12:09,042 --> 00:12:12,076
O‘zgartirilgan joy shu yerda.

250
00:12:12,099 --> 00:12:14,957
Rasmlar ham kattaroq bo‘lgan-ku.

251
00:12:14,981 --> 00:12:16,827
Ha.

252
00:12:16,850 --> 00:12:19,183
Ko‘rinishi yaxshilandi.

253
00:12:19,206 --> 00:12:22,692
Taqdimotni kim bajaradi?

254
00:12:22,716 --> 00:12:26,328
Men birinchi qismini gapiraman.

255
00:12:26,351 --> 00:12:28,218
Tushunarli.

256
00:12:28,241 --> 00:12:33,008
Men oxirgi savol-javob vaqtini olib boraman.

257
00:12:33,031 --> 00:12:34,722
Ha.

258
00:12:34,745 --> 00:12:36,778
Iltimos, yaxshi munosabatda boʻlaylik.

259
00:12:36,801 --> 00:12:40,201
Biroz asabiy bo‘lyapsizmi?

260
00:12:40,224 --> 00:12:43,391
Ha, biroz asabiyman.

261
00:12:43,414 --> 00:12:45,581
Hech qisi yo‘q.

262
00:12:45,604 --> 00:12:48,370
Ko‘p mashq qildingiz-ku.

263
00:12:48,393 --> 00:12:49,927
Ha.

264
00:12:49,950 --> 00:12:52,150
Harakat qilaman.

265
00:12:52,173 --> 00:12:55,506
Yig‘ilishdan keyin nima qilamiz?

266
00:12:55,529 --> 00:12:59,262
Soat 1 dan tushlik qilamiz.

267
00:12:59,285 --> 00:13:01,119
Ajoyib!

268
00:13:01,142 --> 00:13:03,942
Mazzali taomlarni yeyishni boshlaymiz.

269
00:13:03,965 --> 00:13:05,634
Ha.

270
00:13:05,657 --> 00:13:08,124
Kutish bilan kulyapman.

271
00:13:08,147 --> 00:13:11,029
Yigʻilish xonasi uchinchi qavatda, shundaymi?

272
00:13:11,052 --> 00:13:12,855
Ha.

273
00:13:12,879 --> 00:13:16,537
Uchinchi qavatdagi yigʻilish xonasi.

274
00:13:16,560 --> 00:13:20,093
15 daqiqa oldin ofisga boramizmi?

275
00:13:20,116 --> 00:13:21,650
Ha.

276
00:13:21,673 --> 00:13:23,806
Shunday qilaylik.

277
00:13:23,829 --> 00:13:27,103
Endi ofisga boring.

278
00:13:27,126 --> 00:13:28,564
Ha.

279
00:13:28,588 --> 00:13:30,564
Boramiz!

280
00:13:30,587 --> 00:13:32,087
7-SAHNA: Joy va Wi-Fi koʻrsatkichi / Oʻrinlar va Wi-Fi qoʻllanmasi

281
00:13:32,087 --> 00:13:33,961
Xush kelibsiz!

282
00:13:33,985 --> 00:13:36,920
Ixtiyoriy joyga oʻtirishingiz mumkin.

283
00:13:36,943 --> 00:13:38,776
Kechirasiz.

284
00:13:38,799 --> 00:13:42,333
Rozetkali joy qayerda?

285
00:13:42,356 --> 00:13:44,156
Ha.

286
00:13:44,179 --> 00:13:47,512
U yerda, bar stoli yonida bor.

287
00:13:47,535 --> 00:13:49,185
Rahmat.

288
00:13:49,208 --> 00:13:52,175
Men kompyuterdan foydalanmoqchiman.

289
00:13:52,198 --> 00:13:55,398
Sizni bar stoli tomoniga olib boray.

290
00:13:55,421 --> 00:13:57,698
Bu yerga keling.

291
00:13:57,722 --> 00:13:59,363
Rahmat.

292
00:13:59,387 --> 00:14:02,220
Wi-Fi bormi?

293
00:14:02,243 --> 00:14:03,810
Ha.

294
00:14:03,833 --> 00:14:06,709
Bepul Wi-Fi mavjud.

295
00:14:06,732 --> 00:14:10,214
Parol nima?

296
00:14:10,237 --> 00:14:13,735
Parol menyuning orqa tomonida yozilgan.

297
00:14:13,759 --> 00:14:15,835
Bu yerga qarang.

298
00:14:15,859 --> 00:14:17,893
Tushunarli.

299
00:14:17,916 --> 00:14:19,984
Juda yaxshi boʻldi.

300
00:14:20,007 --> 00:14:24,274
Mijozim, bir iltimosim bor.

301
00:14:24,297 --> 00:14:29,497
Band vaqtlarda, iltimos, ikki soatdan koʻp boʻlmagan holda foydalaning.

302
00:14:29,520 --> 00:14:31,087
Ha.

303
00:14:31,110 --> 00:14:32,944
Tushunarli.

304
00:14:32,967 --> 00:14:35,300
Ehtiyot boʻlamiz.

305
00:14:35,323 --> 00:14:38,057
Hamkorligingiz uchun rahmat.

306
00:14:38,080 --> 00:14:41,494
Nima ichishni buyurtma qilmoqchisiz?

307
00:14:41,517 --> 00:14:43,326
Ha.

308
00:14:43,349 --> 00:14:46,549
Issiq kofeni iltimos.

309
00:14:46,572 --> 00:14:49,548
Qaysi hajmni tanlaysiz?

310
00:14:49,572 --> 00:14:52,459
Oʻrta (M) hajmni iltimos.

311
00:14:52,483 --> 00:14:54,561
Tushunarli.

312
00:14:54,584 --> 00:14:57,817
Shakar va sut ishlatasizmi?

313
00:14:57,840 --> 00:15:01,040
Bitta shakar iltimos.

314
00:15:01,063 --> 00:15:02,930
Tushunarli.

315
00:15:02,953 --> 00:15:05,786
Iltimos, biroz kutib turing.

316
00:15:05,809 --> 00:15:07,309
8-SAHNA: Mijozlarga xizmat va qulay muhit / Mijozlarga xizmat va qulay sharoit

317
00:15:07,309 --> 00:15:09,148
Xush kelibsiz!

318
00:15:09,172 --> 00:15:12,816
Mijozim, sovuq emasmisiz?

319
00:15:12,839 --> 00:15:15,373
A, kechirasiz.

320
00:15:15,395 --> 00:15:18,162
Biroz sovuqroq.

321
00:15:18,185 --> 00:15:20,818
Kechirasiz, juda uzr.

322
00:15:20,841 --> 00:15:25,575
Bu yerga konditsioner shamoli toʻgʻridan-toʻgʻri urilayapti.

323
00:15:25,598 --> 00:15:27,164
Ha.

324
00:15:27,187 --> 00:15:30,221
Shamol biroz kuchliroq.

325
00:15:30,244 --> 00:15:33,492
Haroratni biroz oshirib qoʻyamizmi?

326
00:15:33,515 --> 00:15:35,115
Iltimos.

327
00:15:35,138 --> 00:15:39,472
Shuningdek, adyol (adras) bormi?

328
00:15:39,495 --> 00:15:41,728
Ha, bor.

329
00:15:41,751 --> 00:15:44,686
Hozir olib kelaman.

330
00:15:44,710 --> 00:15:46,315
Rahmat.

331
00:15:46,338 --> 00:15:48,305
Juda yaxshi boʻldi.

332
00:15:48,328 --> 00:15:50,561
Kutingiz uchun uzr.

333
00:15:50,584 --> 00:15:54,051
Bu adyoldan foydalaning.

334
00:15:54,074 --> 00:15:55,679
Rahmat.

335
00:15:55,703 --> 00:15:58,379
Juda iliq ekan.

336
00:15:58,402 --> 00:16:00,435
Yaxshi boʻldi.

337
00:16:00,458 --> 00:16:05,192
Agar xohlasangiz, joyingizni oʻzgartirishimiz mumkinmi?

338
00:16:05,215 --> 00:16:08,671
Ha, joyimni oʻzgartirmoqchiman.

339
00:16:08,694 --> 00:16:12,301
U yerda ichki joylar boʻshmi?

340
00:16:12,325 --> 00:16:13,795
Ha.

341
00:16:13,819 --> 00:16:17,513
U yerda toʻrtburchak stol boʻsh turibdi.

342
00:16:17,536 --> 00:16:20,936
U yer tinchmi?

343
00:16:20,959 --> 00:16:25,126
Bugun sekin-asta kitob o‘qimoqchiman.

344
00:16:25,149 --> 00:16:26,282
Ha.

345
00:16:26,305 --> 00:16:29,572
Ichkaridagi joy juda tinch.

346
00:16:29,595 --> 00:16:32,473
Konditsioner shamoli ham tegmaydi.

347
00:16:32,496 --> 00:16:34,766
Yaxshi ekan!

348
00:16:34,790 --> 00:16:38,324
Shunda, u yerga boraylik.

349
00:16:38,347 --> 00:16:41,480
Yukingizni ko‘tarib olaymi?

350
00:16:41,503 --> 00:16:44,503
Yo‘q, o‘zim ko‘taraman.

351
00:16:44,526 --> 00:16:46,659
Yaxshi.

352
00:16:46,682 --> 00:16:48,376
Tushunarli.

353
00:16:48,400 --> 00:16:51,600
Endi sizni joyingizga olib boray.

354
00:16:51,622 --> 00:16:53,189
Rahmat.

355
00:16:53,212 --> 00:16:58,379
A, shundan so‘ng, issiq choydan yana bir piyola iltimos qilaman.

356
00:16:58,402 --> 00:17:00,568
Tushunarli.

357
00:17:00,591 --> 00:17:03,648
Oddiy choy bo‘ladi, to‘g‘rimi?

358
00:17:03,672 --> 00:17:05,311
Ha.

359
00:17:05,334 --> 00:17:07,811
Oddiy choy bering.

360
00:17:07,835 --> 00:17:10,602
Hozir olib kelaman.

361
00:17:10,625 --> 00:17:13,442
Sekin-asta dam oling.

362
00:17:13,466 --> 00:17:15,926
Rahmat.

363
00:17:15,949 --> 00:17:17,449
9-sahna: Kanji va yordamchi so‘zlar mashqi / Kanji va yordamchi so‘zlarni mashq qilish

364
00:17:17,449 --> 00:17:22,249
Bugun ko‘p o‘rganamiz.

365
00:17:22,272 --> 00:17:24,639
Ha, harakat qilamiz!

366
00:17:24,662 --> 00:17:28,628
Keyingi hafta yapon tili testimiz bor ekan, shundaymi?

367
00:17:28,651 --> 00:17:32,531
Ha, N5 testi.

368
00:17:32,555 --> 00:17:35,688
O‘qishlaringiz qanday ketmoqda?

369
00:17:35,711 --> 00:17:40,978
Hmm, kanji biroz qiyin.

370
00:17:41,001 --> 00:17:44,201
Qaysi kanjilar qiyin kelmoqda?

371
00:17:44,224 --> 00:17:48,224
„Hafta“ va „yozmoq“ kanjilari.

372
00:17:48,247 --> 00:17:51,783
A, chiziqlari ko‘p kanjilar, shundaymi?

373
00:17:51,806 --> 00:17:56,474
Ha, eslab qolish qiyin.

374
00:17:56,498 --> 00:17:59,631
Ko‘p marta yozsangiz, eslab qolarsiz.

375
00:17:59,654 --> 00:18:03,832
Shunday, har kuni mashq qilaman.

376
00:18:03,856 --> 00:18:06,136
Grammatika qanday?

377
00:18:06,159 --> 00:18:09,572
Yordamchi so‘zlar ba’zan tushunarsiz bo‘ladi.

378
00:18:09,596 --> 00:18:12,670
„Ni“, „to“ va „de“ farqi, shundaymi?

379
00:18:12,694 --> 00:18:16,361
Ha, ba’zan ikkilanaman.

380
00:18:16,385 --> 00:18:20,427
Unda, hozir masalalar berib, bir-birimizga mashq qilamiz.

381
00:18:20,450 --> 00:18:23,383
Yaxshi, iltimos.

382
00:18:23,406 --> 00:18:26,475
1-savol.

383
00:18:26,499 --> 00:18:30,670
Kafe... o‘qiyman.

384
00:18:30,694 --> 00:18:33,927
Qavs ichiga qaysi yordamchi so‘z keladi?

385
00:18:33,950 --> 00:18:38,232
Joy bo‘lgani uchun „de“, to‘g‘rimi?

386
00:18:38,256 --> 00:18:40,505
To‘g‘ri!

387
00:18:40,528 --> 00:18:42,995
Yaxshi bajardingiz!

388
00:18:43,018 --> 00:18:46,385
Yaxshi, endi tinchlandim.

389
00:18:46,408 --> 00:18:50,490
Endi men savol beraman.

390
00:18:50,513 --> 00:18:52,680
Ha, iltimos.

391
00:18:52,703 --> 00:18:57,073
Ertaga soat 8da turaman.

392
00:18:57,096 --> 00:19:01,764
Qavs ichiga qaysi yordamchi so‘z keladi?

393
00:19:01,788 --> 00:19:06,054
Vaqtdan keyin „ni“ bo‘ladi, shundaymi?

394
00:19:06,077 --> 00:19:08,052
Aniq to‘g‘ri!

395
00:19:08,075 --> 00:19:10,142
Ajoyibsiz!

396
00:19:10,165 --> 00:19:14,062
Uf, biroz charchadim.

397
00:19:14,085 --> 00:19:17,852
Mening ham boshim biroz charchadi.

398
00:19:17,875 --> 00:19:21,242
1 soat atrofida o‘qidik-ku.

399
00:19:21,265 --> 00:19:24,398
Biroz dam olamizmi?

400
00:19:24,421 --> 00:19:28,310
Ha, shirin narsa yeymoqchiman.

401
00:19:28,333 --> 00:19:32,066
Ana u yerda tortlar bor.

402
00:19:32,089 --> 00:19:35,823
Mazali koʻrinadigan qulupnayli tort ekan.

403
00:19:35,846 --> 00:19:38,612
Shokoladli tort ham bor.

404
00:19:38,635 --> 00:19:41,845
Men qulupnayli tortni tanlayman.

405
00:19:41,869 --> 00:19:45,766
Men esa shokoladli tortga qaror qildim.

406
00:19:45,789 --> 00:19:48,723
Ofitsiantni chaqiramizmi?

407
00:19:48,747 --> 00:19:51,429
Ha, chaqiramiz.

408
00:19:51,452 --> 00:19:52,952
10-Sahna: Tushlik tayyorlash va vazifalarni taqsimlash

409
00:19:52,952 --> 00:19:58,185
Tez orada soat 11:45 boʻladi.

410
00:19:58,208 --> 00:20:01,296
Tushlik vaqti keldi.

411
00:20:01,320 --> 00:20:04,322
Ha, ustoz.

412
00:20:04,345 --> 00:20:07,678
Tez orada doʻkon gavjum boʻladi.

413
00:20:07,701 --> 00:20:11,068
Vazifalarni tekshirib olaylik.

414
00:20:11,091 --> 00:20:15,091
Siz bugun kassani boshqarasiz.

415
00:20:15,114 --> 00:20:17,247
Tushunarli.

416
00:20:17,270 --> 00:20:20,948
Men kassada buyurtmalarni qabul qilaman.

417
00:20:20,971 --> 00:20:25,619
Men oshxona va ichimliklar bilan shugʻullanaman.

418
00:20:25,642 --> 00:20:29,076
Sendvich va kofe tayyorlayman.

419
00:20:29,099 --> 00:20:30,865
Ha.

420
00:20:30,888 --> 00:20:33,890
Tayyorlik holatingiz yaxshimi?

421
00:20:33,914 --> 00:20:37,281
Qoshiq va vilkalar bormi?

422
00:20:37,304 --> 00:20:41,312
Kassaga yaqin joylarni tekshiring.

423
00:20:41,336 --> 00:20:45,336
A, qoshiqlar kam qolgan.

424
00:20:45,359 --> 00:20:48,492
Hozir toʻldirib qoʻyaman.

425
00:20:48,515 --> 00:20:50,392
Iltimos.

426
00:20:50,416 --> 00:20:54,883
Olib ketish uchun paketlar va stakanlarni ham tekshiring.

427
00:20:54,906 --> 00:20:56,514
Ha.

428
00:20:56,537 --> 00:21:00,004
Paketlar ham, stakanlar ham koʻp.

429
00:21:00,027 --> 00:21:03,270
Yaxshi boʻldi.

430
00:21:03,294 --> 00:21:06,827
Soʻrgʻichlarni ham unutmang.

431
00:21:06,850 --> 00:21:08,223
Tushunarli.

432
00:21:08,247 --> 00:21:10,899
Soʻrgʻichlar ham tayyor.

433
00:21:10,922 --> 00:21:15,255
Keyin salomlashishni mashq qilaylik.

434
00:21:15,278 --> 00:21:18,812
Katta ovoz bilan salom bera olasizmi?

435
00:21:18,835 --> 00:21:21,635
Ha, bera olaman.

436
00:21:21,658 --> 00:21:23,671
Xush kelibsiz!

437
00:21:23,694 --> 00:21:26,627
Juda yaxshi ovoz ekansiz.

438
00:21:26,650 --> 00:21:29,983
Tabassumingiz ham ajoyib.

439
00:21:30,006 --> 00:21:31,904
Rahmat.

440
00:21:31,928 --> 00:21:34,967
Bugun ham harakat qilaman.

441
00:21:34,991 --> 00:21:39,057
Ha, birga harakat qilamiz.

442
00:21:39,080 --> 00:21:42,280
Mijozlar keldi.

443
00:21:42,303 --> 00:21:45,870
Ha, xush kelibsiz!

444
00:21:45,893 --> 00:21:47,393
11-Sahna: Buyurtma qabul qilish va allergiya tekshiruvi

445
00:21:47,393 --> 00:21:49,393
Xush kelibsiz!

446
00:21:49,416 --> 00:21:52,383
Bu yerda yeysizmi?

447
00:21:52,406 --> 00:21:56,006
Ha, doʻkonda yeyman.

448
00:21:56,028 --> 00:21:57,662
Rahmat.

449
00:21:57,685 --> 00:22:00,851
Buyurtmangizni belgiladingizmi?

450
00:22:00,874 --> 00:22:04,916
Kunlik sendvich toʻplamini iltimos qilaman.

451
00:22:04,940 --> 00:22:08,189
Kunlik sendvich toʻplami, tushunarli.

452
00:22:08,212 --> 00:22:12,748
Bugungi sendvich tovuq va sabzavotli.

453
00:22:12,771 --> 00:22:14,938
Mazali koʻrinadi!

454
00:22:14,962 --> 00:22:17,260
Shuni tanlayman.

455
00:22:17,283 --> 00:22:22,083
Mijozim, ovqatdan allergiyangiz bormi?

456
00:22:22,106 --> 00:22:27,040
Ha, men tuxumga allergiyaman.

457
00:22:27,063 --> 00:22:29,496
Tushunarli.

458
00:22:29,519 --> 00:22:34,286
Sendvichda mayonez bor.

459
00:22:34,309 --> 00:22:38,309
Mayonezda tuxum ishlatiladi.

460
00:22:38,332 --> 00:22:40,415
Shundaymi?

461
00:22:40,438 --> 00:22:44,012
Mayonezni olib tashlash mumkinmi?

462
00:22:44,035 --> 00:22:48,475
Ha, mayonezsiz tayyorlaymiz.

463
00:22:48,498 --> 00:22:50,098
Rahmat.

464
00:22:50,121 --> 00:22:52,140
Juda yaxshi boʻldi.

465
00:22:52,164 --> 00:22:55,964
Ichimlikni qaysi birini tanlaysiz?

466
00:22:55,987 --> 00:22:58,387
Nima bor?

467
00:22:58,410 --> 00:23:03,610
Qahva, choy va apelsin sharbati bor.

468
00:23:03,633 --> 00:23:06,718
Iltimli choy bering, iltimos.

469
00:23:06,741 --> 00:23:09,708
Iltimli choy, tushunarli.

470
00:23:09,731 --> 00:23:12,740
Hisob 1000 yen.

471
00:23:12,764 --> 00:23:15,297
Naqd pul bilan toʻlayman.

472
00:23:15,320 --> 00:23:18,654
Aynan 1000 yen olamiz.

473
00:23:18,676 --> 00:23:22,010
Bu raqamli biletni oling.

474
00:23:22,033 --> 00:23:24,099
Tushunarli.

475
00:23:24,122 --> 00:23:28,165
Tayyor boʻlganda, stolingizgacha olib kelamiz.

476
00:23:28,189 --> 00:23:30,989
Boʻsh joyda kutib turing.

477
00:23:31,012 --> 00:23:33,645
Rahmat.

478
00:23:33,668 --> 00:23:35,168
12-sahna: Hisob-kitob va toʻlov usullari / Toʻlov usullari kassada

479
00:23:35,168 --> 00:23:36,935
Xush kelibsiz!

480
00:23:36,958 --> 00:23:39,026
Hisob-kitob qilamizmi?

481
00:23:39,050 --> 00:23:41,823
Ha, iltimos.

482
00:23:41,846 --> 00:23:44,700
Kunlik tushlik menyusi, shundaymi?

483
00:23:44,723 --> 00:23:48,323
Jami 980 yen.

484
00:23:48,346 --> 00:23:49,961
Tushunarli.

485
00:23:49,985 --> 00:23:52,218
Naqd pul bilan toʻlayman.

486
00:23:52,241 --> 00:23:54,419
A, kechirasiz.

487
00:23:54,443 --> 00:23:56,693
Mayda pul yetmayapti.

488
00:23:56,716 --> 00:23:59,083
1000 yenlik ham yoʻq.

489
00:23:59,106 --> 00:24:01,472
Hech qisi yo‘q.

490
00:24:01,495 --> 00:24:05,162
Elektron pul yoki karta ham ishlatishingiz mumkin.

491
00:24:05,185 --> 00:24:07,072
Yaxshi boʻldi.

492
00:24:07,095 --> 00:24:09,174
Telefon orqali toʻlayman.

493
00:24:09,198 --> 00:24:11,772
Bu shtrix-kodni skaner qiling, iltimos.

494
00:24:11,795 --> 00:24:15,494
Ha, skaner qilamiz.

495
00:24:15,517 --> 00:24:18,852
A, ekran oʻzgarmadi-ku.

496
00:24:18,875 --> 00:24:21,409
Ha, rostmi?

497
00:24:21,432 --> 00:24:24,699
Telefon signal zaif.

498
00:24:24,723 --> 00:24:27,092
Ilova ishlamayapti.

499
00:24:27,115 --> 00:24:30,449
Doʻkonning bepul Wi-Fi si bor.

500
00:24:30,472 --> 00:24:33,705
Bu parolni ishlating.

501
00:24:33,728 --> 00:24:35,304
Rahmat.

502
00:24:35,327 --> 00:24:39,728
Ammo bu vaqt oladi-ku.

503
00:24:39,751 --> 00:24:42,485
Orqada mijozlar turibdi.

504
00:24:42,508 --> 00:24:45,324
Kredit kartangiz bormi?

505
00:24:45,348 --> 00:24:48,348
Ha, karta bor.

506
00:24:48,371 --> 00:24:51,504
Karta bilan ham toʻlashingiz mumkin.

507
00:24:51,527 --> 00:24:54,370
Unda, karta bilan toʻlayman.

508
00:24:54,394 --> 00:24:57,794
Kartani shu yerga tekkizing.

509
00:24:57,817 --> 00:24:59,583
Tekkizdim.

510
00:24:59,606 --> 00:25:02,142
To‘lov yakunlandi.

511
00:25:02,166 --> 00:25:04,966
Chekni oling.

512
00:25:04,989 --> 00:25:06,766
Yordam berdingiz, rahmat.

513
00:25:06,789 --> 00:25:08,589
Rahmat!

514
00:25:08,612 --> 00:25:12,146
Arzimaydi, yana keling.

515
00:25:12,169 --> 00:25:13,669
13-sahna: Sayohat rejasini tuzish / Sayohatni rejalashtirish

516
00:25:13,669 --> 00:25:18,035
Bu sendvich juda mazali ekan-ku!

517
00:25:18,058 --> 00:25:23,525
Ha, mening tuxum sendvichim ham juda mazali.

518
00:25:23,548 --> 00:25:28,081
Bugun kelgusi oy sayohatimiz haqida gaplashamiz.

519
00:25:28,104 --> 00:25:32,562
Ha, Kyoto sayohati uchun reja tuzamiz.

520
00:25:32,585 --> 00:25:34,681
Qachon boramiz?

521
00:25:34,705 --> 00:25:37,913
Kelgusi oy 10-sanasi qanday?

522
00:25:37,937 --> 00:25:41,870
Juma kunidan yakshanbagacha boramiz.

523
00:25:41,893 --> 00:25:43,726
Ajoyib!

524
00:25:43,749 --> 00:25:46,482
2 kecha 3 kun, shundaymi?

525
00:25:46,505 --> 00:25:49,305
Shinkansen (tez poyezd) bilan boramiz.

526
00:25:49,328 --> 00:25:53,695
Yangi tezyurar chiptasini qachon sotib olamiz?

527
00:25:53,718 --> 00:25:57,318
Keyingi hafta internet orqali band qilamiz.

528
00:25:57,341 --> 00:25:59,308
Tushunarli.

529
00:25:59,331 --> 00:26:02,897
Erta tonggi tezyurar yaxshi boʻladi, shunday emasmi?

530
00:26:02,920 --> 00:26:07,720
Ha, ertalab soat 8dagi tezyurarga chiqamiz.

531
00:26:07,743 --> 00:26:11,577
Kiotoga yetib kelganimizda, qayerga borishni xohlaysiz?

532
00:26:11,600 --> 00:26:15,215
Mashhur ibodatxonalarga borishni istayman.

533
00:26:15,238 --> 00:26:18,053
Kiyomizu-dera ibodatxonasiga boring.

534
00:26:18,077 --> 00:26:21,966
Kiyomizu-dera juda ham chiroyli ekan, shundaymi?

535
00:26:21,989 --> 00:26:26,645
Men qadimiy ziyoratgohlarni ham koʻrishni xohlayman.

536
00:26:26,669 --> 00:26:30,149
Unda Fushimi Inari Taisha ziyoratgohiga ham boring.

537
00:26:30,172 --> 00:26:31,774
Ajoyib!

538
00:26:31,798 --> 00:26:35,610
Kiotoning mazali kafelariga ham borishni xohlayman.

539
00:26:35,633 --> 00:26:39,000
Matcha muzqaymoq yeyishni taklif qilaman!

540
00:26:39,023 --> 00:26:41,081
Juda ham qiziqarlisi kelmoqda!

541
00:26:41,104 --> 00:26:44,271
Mehmonxonani qayerga olishni rejalashtirmoqdasiz?

542
00:26:44,294 --> 00:26:47,900
Kiyoto stansiyasiga yaqin mehmonxona qulay boʻladi.

543
00:26:47,924 --> 00:26:50,621
Byudjet qancha boʻlishini oʻylaysiz?

544
00:26:50,644 --> 00:26:53,977
Har birimiz uchun taxminan 50 ming yen deb oʻylayman.

545
00:26:54,000 --> 00:26:55,972
Tushunarli.

546
00:26:55,996 --> 00:27:00,207
Tezyurar va mehmonxona uchun 30 ming yen ketadi.

547
00:27:00,230 --> 00:27:03,463
Ovqatlanish va xarid qilish uchun 20 ming yen kerak boʻladi.

548
00:27:03,486 --> 00:27:05,737
Aynan mos keladi!

549
00:27:05,761 --> 00:27:10,094
Bugun kechqurun mehmonxonani band qilaman.

550
00:27:10,117 --> 00:27:11,684
Rahmat.

551
00:27:11,707 --> 00:27:13,907
Iltimos, yaxshi munosabatda boʻlaylik.

552
00:27:13,930 --> 00:27:15,465
Ha.

553
00:27:15,488 --> 00:27:18,340
Qiziqarli sayohatga aylanishini tilaymiz!

554
00:27:18,363 --> 00:27:19,863
14-Sahna: Band tushlik va kassa yopilishi

555
00:27:19,863 --> 00:27:22,333
Mehnatingiz uchun rahmat.

556
00:27:22,357 --> 00:27:26,047
Tushlikdagi bandlik tugadi, shundaymi?

557
00:27:26,070 --> 00:27:28,313
Mehnatingiz uchun rahmat.

558
00:27:28,336 --> 00:27:32,170
Bugun juda ham band edik.

559
00:27:32,193 --> 00:27:33,999
Ha.

560
00:27:34,022 --> 00:27:38,115
Koʻp mijozlar keldi.

561
00:27:38,139 --> 00:27:41,539
Sendvichlar juda yaxshi sotildi.

562
00:27:41,562 --> 00:27:44,702
Sharbatlar ham yaxshi ketdi.

563
00:27:44,725 --> 00:27:48,691
Endi oraliq kassa yopilishini boshlaymiz.

564
00:27:48,714 --> 00:27:51,581
Pulni hisoblang.

565
00:27:51,604 --> 00:27:53,776
Tushunarli.

566
00:27:53,799 --> 00:27:56,999
Kassadagi pullarni sanayapman.

567
00:27:57,022 --> 00:28:00,422
Ming yenliklar nechtadan bor?

568
00:28:00,445 --> 00:28:04,312
Ming yenliklar yigirmadan bor.

569
00:28:04,335 --> 00:28:07,501
Besh yuz yenlik tangalar qanday?

570
00:28:07,524 --> 00:28:11,262
Besh yuz yenlik tangalar oʻndan bor.

571
00:28:11,285 --> 00:28:15,324
Jami summani tekshirib koʻraylik.

572
00:28:15,348 --> 00:28:18,630
Kompyuterdagi raqam bilan bir xilmi?

573
00:28:18,653 --> 00:28:20,520
Ha.

574
00:28:20,543 --> 00:28:23,310
Ha, bir xil summa.

575
00:28:23,333 --> 00:28:26,300
Yaxshi boʻldi.

576
00:28:26,323 --> 00:28:29,256
Kassa yopilishi tugadi.

577
00:28:29,279 --> 00:28:31,412
Endi xotirjam boʻldim.

578
00:28:31,435 --> 00:28:34,002
Endi tanaffusga chiqamizmi?

579
00:28:34,025 --> 00:28:35,663
Ha.

580
00:28:35,687 --> 00:28:39,220
Navbat bilan oʻn besh daqiqa dam olamiz.

581
00:28:39,243 --> 00:28:43,416
Avval siz dam oling.

582
00:28:43,439 --> 00:28:45,092
Rahmat.

583
00:28:45,116 --> 00:28:47,974
Ichimlik ichsam boʻladi mi?

584
00:28:47,997 --> 00:28:49,637
Ha.

585
00:28:49,661 --> 00:28:53,027
Sevimli ichimlikingizni tayyorlang.

586
00:28:53,050 --> 00:28:56,184
Sovuq choy ichaman.

587
00:28:56,207 --> 00:29:00,007
Shakarning ozini solaman.

588
00:29:00,030 --> 00:29:03,363
Dam olish xonasida bemalol dam oling.

589
00:29:03,386 --> 00:29:07,243
O'n besh daqiqadan keyin qayting.

590
00:29:07,267 --> 00:29:08,883
Ha.

591
00:29:08,906 --> 00:29:11,740
Qaytganimda almashtiramiz.

592
00:29:11,763 --> 00:29:13,996
Iltimos, yaxshi munosabatda boʻlaylik.

593
00:29:14,019 --> 00:29:16,619
Tushdan keyin ham tirishamiz.

594
00:29:16,642 --> 00:29:18,142
15-SAHNA: KAFEYDA BUYURTMA BERISH / Kafeyda buyurtma berish tartibi

595
00:29:18,142 --> 00:29:20,011
Xush kelibsiz!

596
00:29:20,035 --> 00:29:22,803
Ixtiyoriy joyga oʻtirishingiz mumkin.

597
00:29:22,826 --> 00:29:24,710
Rahmat.

598
00:29:24,734 --> 00:29:27,067
Shu yerga o'tiring.

599
00:29:27,091 --> 00:29:31,105
Buyurtma berishga tayyor bo'lsangiz, chaqiring.

600
00:29:31,128 --> 00:29:32,766
Kechirasiz.

601
00:29:32,789 --> 00:29:35,237
Buyurtma berishni iltimos qilaman.

602
00:29:35,261 --> 00:29:36,994
Ha.

603
00:29:37,017 --> 00:29:39,631
Buyurtmangizni aytishingiz mumkin.

604
00:29:39,655 --> 00:29:43,188
Shirin narsa yeyishni xohlayman.

605
00:29:43,211 --> 00:29:46,145
Tavsiya qiladigan tortingiz bormi?

606
00:29:46,168 --> 00:29:49,846
Kuz mavsumiga xos tortni tavsiya qilamiz.

607
00:29:49,869 --> 00:29:52,515
Shirin kashtanli tort juda mashhur.

608
00:29:52,539 --> 00:29:54,984
Shirin kashtanli tortmi?

609
00:29:55,007 --> 00:29:57,174
Mazali koʻrinadi!

610
00:29:57,197 --> 00:30:00,472
Matcha parfe ham juda mashhur.

611
00:30:00,495 --> 00:30:03,429
Ikkalasi ham yaxshi ko'rinadi.

612
00:30:03,452 --> 00:30:05,261
Qaysi birini tanlashda qiynalaman.

613
00:30:05,284 --> 00:30:09,183
Shirin kashtanli tort juda shirin emas.

614
00:30:09,206 --> 00:30:11,539
Kofe bilan juda yaxshi mos keladi.

615
00:30:11,562 --> 00:30:13,529
Shundaymi?

616
00:30:13,552 --> 00:30:16,752
Shunda, shirin kashtanli tortni tanlayman.

617
00:30:16,775 --> 00:30:18,392
Rahmat.

618
00:30:18,416 --> 00:30:21,049
Ichimlik nima bo'lsin?

619
00:30:21,072 --> 00:30:23,907
Iltimos, issiq kofe bering.

620
00:30:23,930 --> 00:30:27,788
Tort va kofe to'plami arzonroq.

621
00:30:27,812 --> 00:30:30,661
50 so'm arzonroq bo'ladi.

622
00:30:30,685 --> 00:30:33,251
Yaxshi ekan!

623
00:30:33,274 --> 00:30:35,453
To'plamni iltimos qilaman.

624
00:30:35,477 --> 00:30:37,610
Tushunarli.

625
00:30:37,633 --> 00:30:41,766
Shirin kashtanli tort va issiq kofe, shundaymi?

626
00:30:41,789 --> 00:30:43,437
Ha.

627
00:30:43,461 --> 00:30:45,461
Iltimos, yaxshi munosabatda boʻlaylik.

628
00:30:45,484 --> 00:30:47,817
Iltimos, biroz kutib turing.

629
00:30:47,840 --> 00:30:51,007
Stolingizgacha olib boramiz.

630
00:30:51,030 --> 00:30:52,630
Tushunarli.

631
00:30:52,653 --> 00:30:55,224
Kutishdan sabrsizlanmoqdaman.

632
00:30:55,247 --> 00:30:56,747
16-SAHNA: Yangi latte tayyorlash usuli / Yangi Latte Qanday Tayyorlanadi

633
00:30:56,747 --> 00:31:00,222
Hozir biroz tinchroq, shunday emasmi?

634
00:31:00,245 --> 00:31:04,212
Yangi menyu uchun mashq qilaylik.

635
00:31:04,235 --> 00:31:06,368
Ha, iltimos.

636
00:31:06,391 --> 00:31:11,125
Yaqin kunlarda yangi latte taqdim qilamiz.

637
00:31:11,148 --> 00:31:14,714
Matcha latte va karamel latte.

638
00:31:14,737 --> 00:31:17,771
Ikkalasi ham juda mazali koʻrinadi.

639
00:31:17,794 --> 00:31:20,927
Tayyorlash qiyinmi?

640
00:31:20,950 --> 00:31:23,750
Qiyin emas.

641
00:31:23,773 --> 00:31:27,773
Avval karamel latteni tayyorlaymiz.

642
00:31:27,796 --> 00:31:31,929
Xoʻp, stakan tayyorlang.

643
00:31:31,952 --> 00:31:36,204
Karamel siropidan 15 gramm soling.

644
00:31:36,227 --> 00:31:39,044
Qoshiq bilan aniq oʻlchang.

645
00:31:39,068 --> 00:31:41,868
15 gramm, shundaymi?

646
00:31:41,891 --> 00:31:44,425
Sirop solindi.

647
00:31:44,448 --> 00:31:48,814
Keyin espresso qoʻshamiz.

648
00:31:48,837 --> 00:31:51,471
Tugmani bir marta bosing.

649
00:31:51,494 --> 00:31:54,761
Espresso quyiladi.

650
00:31:54,784 --> 00:31:57,718
Qanday yaxshi hid taratayapti!

651
00:31:57,741 --> 00:32:01,478
Shundan soʻng, sutni isitamiz.

652
00:32:01,501 --> 00:32:05,747
Bugʻ bilan mayda koʻpik hosil qiling.

653
00:32:05,771 --> 00:32:08,811
Sut harorati qancha boʻlishi kerak?

654
00:32:08,834 --> 00:32:12,319
65 daraja eng yaxshi variant.

655
00:32:12,343 --> 00:32:15,810
Juda issiq boʻlsa, mazasi chiqmaydi.

656
00:32:15,833 --> 00:32:17,966
Tushunarli.

657
00:32:17,989 --> 00:32:21,088
65 darajagacha isitildi.

658
00:32:21,111 --> 00:32:24,547
Sutni sekinlik bilan quying.

659
00:32:24,571 --> 00:32:28,804
Eng ustiga karamel sousini quyamiz.

660
00:32:28,827 --> 00:32:30,594
Tayyor!

661
00:32:30,617 --> 00:32:32,954
Juda chiroyli chiqdi.

662
00:32:32,977 --> 00:32:35,344
Ta'mi qanday?

663
00:32:35,367 --> 00:32:38,767
Juda shirin va mazali.

664
00:32:38,790 --> 00:32:42,057
Keyin matcha latte tayyorlaymiz.

665
00:32:42,080 --> 00:32:46,713
Matcha kukunini issiq suvda yaxshilab eriting.

666
00:32:46,736 --> 00:32:48,269
Ha.

667
00:32:48,292 --> 00:32:50,959
Qattiq aralashtiring.

668
00:32:50,982 --> 00:32:52,482
17-Sahna: Yo'qolgan narsalarni qidirish / Yo'qolgan narsalarni topish usuli

669
00:32:52,482 --> 00:32:54,415
Xush kelibsiz!

670
00:32:54,438 --> 00:32:56,405
Salom.

671
00:32:56,428 --> 00:32:58,280
Kechirasiz.

672
00:32:58,303 --> 00:33:01,313
Yo'qolgan narsalarimni qidiryapman.

673
00:33:01,337 --> 00:33:04,142
Yo'qolgan narsa, shundaymi?

674
00:33:04,165 --> 00:33:08,165
Bugun bu yerga kelgan edingizmi?

675
00:33:08,188 --> 00:33:09,963
Ha.

676
00:33:09,987 --> 00:33:14,120
Bugun soat o'n ikki yarim atrofida keldim.

677
00:33:14,143 --> 00:33:16,149
Tushunarli.

678
00:33:16,173 --> 00:33:19,506
Qaysi stulda o'tirgansiz?

679
00:33:19,529 --> 00:33:23,605
Ichkaridagi derazaga yaqin stulda.

680
00:33:23,628 --> 00:33:27,228
Stol ustida unutib qoldirdim.

681
00:33:27,251 --> 00:33:31,384
Nimani unutib qoldingiz?

682
00:33:31,407 --> 00:33:36,262
Qora katlanadigan soyabon va kichik sumka.

683
00:33:36,286 --> 00:33:39,087
Batafsilroq aytib bering.

684
00:33:39,110 --> 00:33:42,577
Soyabon qanday shaklda?

685
00:33:42,600 --> 00:33:46,733
Qora va kichik katlanadigan soyabon.

686
00:33:46,756 --> 00:33:50,495
Dastasi joyida ko'k rangli stiker bor.

687
00:33:50,518 --> 00:33:54,252
Sumka qanday sumka?

688
00:33:54,275 --> 00:33:57,935
Jigarrang charm sumka.

689
00:33:57,958 --> 00:34:00,451
Ikki cho'ntagi bor.

690
00:34:00,474 --> 00:34:02,722
Tushunarli.

691
00:34:02,746 --> 00:34:06,583
Ichkaridagi saqlash joyiga qarab kelaman.

692
00:34:06,606 --> 00:34:09,039
Iltimos, biroz kutib turing.

693
00:34:09,062 --> 00:34:10,747
Ha.

694
00:34:10,770 --> 00:34:13,041
Iltimos, yaxshi munosabatda boʻlaylik.

695
00:34:13,065 --> 00:34:15,498
Kutingiz uchun uzr.

696
00:34:15,521 --> 00:34:17,795
Bu sizniki mi?

697
00:34:17,818 --> 00:34:19,955
Ha, shunday.

698
00:34:19,979 --> 00:34:22,983
Bu mening soyabonim va sumkam.

699
00:34:23,006 --> 00:34:25,740
Rahmat, chin chin.

700
00:34:25,763 --> 00:34:28,129
Yaxshi boʻldi.

701
00:34:28,152 --> 00:34:32,219
Tasdiqlash uchun ismingizni aytib bering.

702
00:34:32,242 --> 00:34:34,861
Tanaka.

703
00:34:34,885 --> 00:34:37,218
Tanaka Kenta.

704
00:34:37,241 --> 00:34:39,808
Tanaka-sansiz, shundaymi?

705
00:34:39,831 --> 00:34:43,398
Bu qog'ozga ismingizni yozing.

706
00:34:43,421 --> 00:34:45,354
Ha.

707
00:34:45,377 --> 00:34:47,235
Yozib bo'ldim.

708
00:34:47,259 --> 00:34:48,937
Rahmat.

709
00:34:48,961 --> 00:34:51,894
Yo'qolgan narsalaringizni qaytarib beraman.

710
00:34:51,917 --> 00:34:54,093
Yordam berdingiz, rahmat.

711
00:34:54,117 --> 00:34:57,090
Rahmat, chin chin.

712
00:34:57,114 --> 00:35:01,651
Arzimaydi, yana kelishingizni kutamiz.

713
00:35:01,675 --> 00:35:03,175
18-Sahna: Muhim imtihon tufayli dam olish so'rovi / Muhim imtihon sababli ta'til so'rash

714
00:35:03,175 --> 00:35:05,655
Xayrli kun.

715
00:35:05,679 --> 00:35:09,279
Hozir ozgina vaqt bormi?

716
00:35:09,302 --> 00:35:11,868
Xayrli kun.

717
00:35:11,891 --> 00:35:14,925
Ha, muammo yo'q.

718
00:35:14,947 --> 00:35:18,200
Aslida, maslahatlashmoqchiman.

719
00:35:18,224 --> 00:35:21,990
Kelgusi shanba haqida.

720
00:35:22,013 --> 00:35:25,147
Kelgusi shanba, shundaymi?

721
00:35:25,170 --> 00:35:27,446
Nima bo'ldi?

722
00:35:27,469 --> 00:35:31,802
Kelgusi shanba kuni test boʻladi.

723
00:35:31,825 --> 00:35:35,281
Bu universitet uchun muhim test.

724
00:35:35,305 --> 00:35:37,485
Shundaymi?

725
00:35:37,508 --> 00:35:40,041
Testlar qiyin boʻladi, shunday emasmi?

726
00:35:40,064 --> 00:35:41,998
Ha.

727
00:35:42,021 --> 00:35:46,319
Shuning uchun ishdan dam olmoqchiman.

728
00:35:46,342 --> 00:35:48,217
Tushunarli.

729
00:35:48,241 --> 00:35:51,974
Men shanba kuni vaqtim bor.

730
00:35:51,997 --> 00:35:54,164
Rostdanmi?

731
00:35:54,187 --> 00:35:58,477
Mening oʻrnima smenaga kirib berolmaysizmi?

732
00:35:58,500 --> 00:36:01,700
Ha, albatta.

733
00:36:01,723 --> 00:36:04,132
Shanba kuni ishlayman.

734
00:36:04,156 --> 00:36:07,043
Rahmat, chin chin.

735
00:36:07,067 --> 00:36:09,400
Juda katta yordam boʻldingiz.

736
00:36:09,423 --> 00:36:13,482
Yoʻq, arzimaydi.

737
00:36:13,505 --> 00:36:16,605
Testga tayyorlanishda omad tilayman!

738
00:36:16,628 --> 00:36:19,638
Ha, harakat qilaman.

739
00:36:19,662 --> 00:36:24,596
Buning evaziga yakshanba kuni men ishlayman.

740
00:36:24,619 --> 00:36:27,285
Yakshanbami?

741
00:36:27,308 --> 00:36:31,075
Mening smenam yakshanba kuniga toʻgʻri keladi-ku.

742
00:36:31,098 --> 00:36:32,751
Ha.

743
00:36:32,775 --> 00:36:37,741
Yakshanba kuni men sizning oʻrniga ishlayman.

744
00:36:37,764 --> 00:36:39,531
Rahmat.

745
00:36:39,554 --> 00:36:42,887
Unda yakshanba kuni sizga ishonaman.

746
00:36:42,910 --> 00:36:46,444
Ha, tushunarli.

747
00:36:46,467 --> 00:36:49,435
Doʻkon mudiriga ham aytib qoʻyaman.

748
00:36:49,458 --> 00:36:52,335
Ha, iltimos.

749
00:36:52,358 --> 00:36:55,158
Har doim yordamingiz uchun raxmat.

750
00:36:55,181 --> 00:36:59,582
Navbatda men sizga shirin sharbat olib kelaman.

751
00:36:59,605 --> 00:37:01,539
Hehe, raxmat.

752
00:37:01,562 --> 00:37:04,832
Endi tanaffusni tugataylik.

753
00:37:04,855 --> 00:37:08,855
Ha, ishga qaytaylik.

754
00:37:08,878 --> 00:37:10,378
19-SAHNA: Mijozlarga xizmat koʻrsatish asoslari

755
00:37:10,378 --> 00:37:12,231
Kechirasiz.

756
00:37:12,254 --> 00:37:14,295
Kechirasiz.

757
00:37:14,319 --> 00:37:17,253
Ha, nima uchun murojaat qilyapsiz?

758
00:37:17,275 --> 00:37:22,076
Dokonimizdan doimo foydalanib turganingiz uchun katta rahmat.

759
00:37:22,100 --> 00:37:25,634
Yaqin orada soat 20:00 da doʻkon yopiladi.

760
00:37:25,657 --> 00:37:29,057
A, allaqachon shuncha vaqt boʻldimi?

761
00:37:29,080 --> 00:37:31,113
Tushunarli.

762
00:37:31,136 --> 00:37:34,936
Boʻshagan kosalaringizni olib qoʻyishim mumkinmi?

763
00:37:34,959 --> 00:37:37,492
Ha, iltimos.

764
00:37:37,515 --> 00:37:39,963
Bu kosami?

765
00:37:39,987 --> 00:37:41,787
Rahmat.

766
00:37:41,810 --> 00:37:44,410
Endi olib qoʻyaman.

767
00:37:44,433 --> 00:37:47,110
Sekin tayyorlanib oling.

768
00:37:47,134 --> 00:37:51,568
Ha, darrov buyumlarimni yigʻishtiraman.

769
00:37:51,591 --> 00:37:54,558
Toʻlovni kassada qabul qilamiz.

770
00:37:54,581 --> 00:37:58,514
Bugun naqd pul va kredit karta bilan toʻlash mumkin.

771
00:37:58,537 --> 00:38:01,196
Kredit karta bilan toʻlayman.

772
00:38:01,219 --> 00:38:04,553
Kiyimimni kiyib, kassaga boraman.

773
00:38:04,576 --> 00:38:06,176
Tushunarli.

774
00:38:06,199 --> 00:38:08,933
Kassada sizni kutib turamiz.

775
00:38:08,956 --> 00:38:10,723
Kechirasiz.

776
00:38:10,746 --> 00:38:12,963
Iltimos, hisob-kitobni bajaring.

777
00:38:12,986 --> 00:38:16,961
Ha, issiq kofe va pirojnoe.

778
00:38:16,985 --> 00:38:19,918
Jami 800 yen boʻladi.

779
00:38:19,941 --> 00:38:21,874
Karta bilan toʻlayman.

780
00:38:21,897 --> 00:38:24,331
Kartangizni olaman.

781
00:38:24,354 --> 00:38:27,052
Bir martada toʻlashni xohlaysizmi?

782
00:38:27,076 --> 00:38:30,443
Ha, bir martada toʻlayman.

783
00:38:30,467 --> 00:38:33,345
Chek va kartangizni qaytarib beraman.

784
00:38:33,368 --> 00:38:35,535
Iltimos, tekshirib koʻring.

785
00:38:35,558 --> 00:38:37,326
Rahmat.

786
00:38:37,349 --> 00:38:40,205
Bu kofe juda mazali edi.

787
00:38:40,229 --> 00:38:41,766
Rahmat.

788
00:38:41,790 --> 00:38:44,757
Bunday deb aytganingizdan xursandman.

789
00:38:44,780 --> 00:38:48,980
Bugun kecha juda sovuq, shuning uchun ehtiyot boʻling.

790
00:38:49,003 --> 00:38:50,848
Rahmat.

791
00:38:50,871 --> 00:38:53,038
Yana kelaman.

792
00:38:53,061 --> 00:38:54,718
Rahmat.

793
00:38:54,742 --> 00:38:58,775
Sizni yana koʻrishni chin dildan kutamiz.

794
00:38:58,798 --> 00:39:01,365
Yaxshi kecha tilayman.

795
00:39:01,388 --> 00:39:04,032
Yaxshi kecha tilayman.

796
00:39:04,055 --> 00:39:05,555
20-SAHNA: Yopilish va bugungi savdo hisoboti

797
00:39:05,555 --> 00:39:08,394
Bugun ham yaxshi ish qildingiz.

798
00:39:08,417 --> 00:39:11,550
Doʻkon eshigining kalitini berkitdingizmi?

799
00:39:11,573 --> 00:39:14,252
Ha, berkitdim.

800
00:39:14,276 --> 00:39:18,409
Tashqi reklamani ham ichkariga oldim.

801
00:39:18,432 --> 00:39:20,286
Rahmat.

802
00:39:20,310 --> 00:39:24,545
Endi kassadagi pullarni hisoblaymiz.

803
00:39:24,568 --> 00:39:28,020
Ha, men hisoblayman.

804
00:39:28,044 --> 00:39:31,977
Ming soʻmliklar yigirmata bor.

805
00:39:32,000 --> 00:39:35,659
Besh ming soʻmliklar nechta?

806
00:39:35,683 --> 00:39:39,250
Besh ming soʻmliklar toʻrtta bor.

807
00:39:39,273 --> 00:39:43,075
Oʻn ming soʻmliklar oltita, shundaymi?

808
00:39:43,098 --> 00:39:45,532
Mayda pullarni ham hisobladim.

809
00:39:45,555 --> 00:39:48,488
Bugungi savdo necha pul boʻldi?

810
00:39:48,511 --> 00:39:51,678
Ha, yuz ming soʻm.

811
00:39:51,701 --> 00:39:54,120
Ajoyib!

812
00:39:54,143 --> 00:39:57,279
Kassadagi raqam bilan bir xil.

813
00:39:57,302 --> 00:39:59,240
Yaxshi boʻldi.

814
00:39:59,264 --> 00:40:02,330
Keyin chiqindi tashlaymizmi?

815
00:40:02,353 --> 00:40:04,410
Ha, iltimos.

816
00:40:04,434 --> 00:40:07,967
Oshxonadagi chiqindi xaltalarini yigʻing.

817
00:40:07,990 --> 00:40:09,842
Tushunarli.

818
00:40:09,865 --> 00:40:13,151
Orqadagi chiqindi joyiga olib boraman.

819
00:40:13,174 --> 00:40:16,642
Men daftar yozaman.

820
00:40:16,666 --> 00:40:20,099
Ertangi tongda xodimlarga xabar beraman.

821
00:40:20,122 --> 00:40:22,356
Nima yozasiz?

822
00:40:22,380 --> 00:40:26,350
Sut kam qolganini yozaman.

823
00:40:26,374 --> 00:40:32,007
Ertaga tongda yangi sut olib kelishingizni ayting.

824
00:40:32,030 --> 00:40:34,597
Bu juda muhim.

825
00:40:34,620 --> 00:40:37,293
Chiqindilarni tashlash tugadi.

826
00:40:37,316 --> 00:40:40,329
Chiroq va konditsionerni oʻchiring.

827
00:40:40,353 --> 00:40:42,753
Ha, oʻchirdim.

828
00:40:42,776 --> 00:40:45,634
Unutgan narsangiz yoʻqmi?

829
00:40:45,657 --> 00:40:48,590
Ha, hammasi joyida.

830
00:40:48,613 --> 00:40:50,981
Endi ketamiz.

831
00:40:51,005 --> 00:40:54,343
Bugun ham mehnatingiz uchun raxmat.

832
00:40:54,366 --> 00:40:56,700
Mehnatingiz uchun rahmat.

833
00:40:56,723 --> 00:40:59,656
Men oldinroq ketaman.